1
00:01:38,470 --> 00:01:43,940
[Small Town Remedy]

2
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:46,729
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:47,479 --> 00:01:48,350
President!

4
00:01:49,509 --> 00:01:51,400
I went to your place to look for you,

5
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,200
but you were not there.

6
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:52,640
So I guessed

7
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:54,570
you must be working overtime here.

8
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,400
How did you get so blotto?

9
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,710
Didn't I go as you

10
00:01:58,710 --> 00:01:59,590
instructed?

11
00:01:59,870 --> 00:02:01,330
I was with Liu Zhengliang.

12
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:02,870
Let me report to you

13
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:03,840
about this Liu Zhengliang.

14
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,710
Guess how he reacted at dinner?

15
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,000
He stood up

16
00:02:07,150 --> 00:02:08,190
and left!

17
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,150
Oh, my...

18
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:12,280
H-He's got quite a personality.

19
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,910
He said, "I can't drink."

20
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:16,030
He really couldn't take even a single sip.

21
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:16,710
And I said, "You..."

22
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:17,470
Can you tell me

23
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:18,800
something I don't know?

24
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,329
Mingming and Zhang Hao are
getting a divorce.

25
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,520
The point is that I have no idea

26
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,050
when they even got married!

27
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,120
Long, did you know?

28
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,260
What's there to make a fuss about?

29
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,360
What happened?

30
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:50,490
[Harmony in Diversity]

31
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:48,630
Later,

32
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:52,910
he shacked up

33
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,800
with that woman.

34
00:02:57,870 --> 00:03:00,750
The two of them lived off collecting rent.

35
00:03:02,150 --> 00:03:02,870
They did nothing

36
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:04,270
other than play mahjong.

37
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:06,310
And then,

38
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:11,310
he also broke up with that woman

39
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,240
and kept hooking up with new people.

40
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,030
That was

41
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:24,880
exactly when my mom passed away

42
00:03:26,590 --> 00:03:28,390
from a relapse of breast cancer.

43
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,760
He infuriated my mom
and drove her to death.

44
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,590
You must hate his guts now.

45
00:03:41,430 --> 00:03:41,910
Yep.

46
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:54,590
I'm not asking you
to repay hatred with kindness.

47
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:56,990
I wonder
if you've ever thought about this.

48
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,680
If he dies here today

49
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,280
because you refused to sign,

50
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:03,240
you'll carry that burden
for the rest of your life,

51
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,700
which will be hard to bear.

52
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,470
I won't regret it.

53
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,940
I just want to take revenge on him.

54
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:15,360
I see.

55
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,220
Alright, then,

56
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:19,720
let's talk about

57
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,180
how to take revenge on him.

58
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,630
Right now,

59
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,050
he can't feel anything.

60
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,800
If he just dies this way,

61
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,060
he'll get off too easy.

62
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,290
Let me tell you a little secret.

63
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:36,240
At his age,

64
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,480
even if the surgery

65
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:41,040
cures him,

66
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,950
his womanizing days will be over.

67
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:46,750
Living like this is actually

68
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,870
worse than death for him.

69
00:04:50,159 --> 00:04:50,720
He might

70
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,240
even come to you

71
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:55,070
and use the family ties

72
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,320
to seek some father-daughter comfort.

73
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,320
You must not forgive him.

74
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:01,600
Just let him

75
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,480
endure this all alone.

76
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:04,870
The older he gets, the lonelier

77
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:06,530
and more miserable he will be.

78
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,780
Wouldn't that b-be more satisfying?

79
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:26,040
[Reserve Medical Equipment]

80
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:39,720
Tell the 4th-floor staff
to get ready immediately.

81
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:47,210
[Reserve Medical Equipment]

82
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,430
How did you pull this off?

83
00:05:43,430 --> 00:05:44,480
I don't know either.

84
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,010
I've talked myself hoarse.

85
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,600
-One, two, go.
-One, two, go.

86
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:34,950
Son, you're back.

87
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,620
Why is your face so red?

88
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:38,920
Are you freezing

89
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,190
or having a fever?

90
00:06:40,190 --> 00:06:42,190
It's from the strong gusts outside.

91
00:06:42,430 --> 00:06:43,430
Hurry, come on in.

92
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,720
You didn't

93
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:01,390
go to work all day.

94
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,920
I don't know what you've been

95
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,450
fooling around with today.

96
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,750
I wasn't fooling around.

97
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:07,350
[999 Cold Medicine]

98
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,560
I took the day off.

99
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,430
Chen Junnan,

100
00:07:09,430 --> 00:07:11,160
look at your attitude now.

101
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:13,040
Do you want to quit or what?

102
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,190
What attitude?

103
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,390
Didn't I tell you before?

104
00:07:15,390 --> 00:07:16,430
If you want to quit, what else can you do?

105
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,000
What are you capable of?

106
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,160
I can do anything!

107
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:18,870
As long as I'm

108
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:19,920
not working under your nose,

109
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,000
I can do anything!

110
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,430
If I do well,

111
00:07:22,430 --> 00:07:24,190
people think
I'm riding on your coat-tails.

112
00:07:24,190 --> 00:07:26,040
If I don't do well,

113
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:28,360
I embarrass you.

114
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,390
So what if you ride on my coat-tails?

115
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:30,920
You're benefiting from me!

116
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,750
Others want to but can't.

117
00:07:32,750 --> 00:07:34,000
Don't complain!

118
00:07:34,159 --> 00:07:36,220
You've got your father to back you up.

119
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,480
You should consider yourself lucky!

120
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,390
I don't need it.

121
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:41,070
I can make a living off anything.

122
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:42,920
I...

123
00:07:43,159 --> 00:07:44,360
Then what do you want?

124
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,800
I wasn't joking before.

125
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,430
I just want to resign...

126
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,490
and join Xiaoximen.

127
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,510
Come on.

128
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,040
Take this cold medicine now.

129
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,100
Don't catch a cold.

130
00:08:01,390 --> 00:08:02,450
Careful, it's hot.

131
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,720
G-Go drink it back in your room.

132
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,600
Go ahead.

133
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,920
Look how freezing you are.

134
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,390
Go.

135
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:12,450
Are you sure
you want to join Xiaoximen Hospital?

136
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,160
I'm sure.

137
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:27,310
What did I say?

138
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,920
Junnan wasn't just talking out of anger.

139
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,600
He went to visit Liu Zhengliang last time

140
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,909
and came back telling us

141
00:08:32,909 --> 00:08:34,720
that Liu Zhengliang
was very excellent, right?

142
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,030
But the point is that

143
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,150
Liu Zhengliang is

144
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,320
way too outstanding.

145
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,360
Word of his surgery

146
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,220
has spread all over our hospital.

147
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,360
That surgery was so hard that I-I...

148
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,670
Even I couldn't do it.

149
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,000
Technically,

150
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,550
t-this is a good thing.

151
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,480
It is a good thing.

152
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,630
But if the two of them work together,

153
00:08:50,630 --> 00:08:51,360
by comparison,

154
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:53,000
he'll be outshone obviously

155
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,510
and look bad!

156
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,300
Right now in our hospital,

157
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,550
I can take care of him.

158
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:58,480
If he goes to Xiaoximen,

159
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,750
who will look after him?

160
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:01,510
If he can't figure out
how to treat patients,

161
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:02,200
what will he do?

162
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,030
If he can't finish the surgery

163
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:05,160
in the operating room, what will he do?

164
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:09,480
How about this?

165
00:09:10,150 --> 00:09:11,960
I'll invite Zhengliang over

166
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,670
for dinner someday.

167
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:15,270
You can have a good talk with him

168
00:09:15,270 --> 00:09:16,720
and ask him to guide Junnan.

169
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,480
Is that okay?

170
00:09:18,670 --> 00:09:20,480
Alright, that's the only way.

171
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:24,860
[Beiji Pharmacy]

172
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:28,010
[Divorce Certificate] [Holder: Zhang Hao]

173
00:09:28,060 --> 00:09:30,280
[Holder: Che Mingming]

174
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:44,030
[Marriage Registration Office
of Tiedong District Civil Affairs Bureau]

175
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:53,000
Where are you going?
I can give you a ride.

176
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,660
No, thanks. I'll take the bus.

177
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,500
Time to eat.

178
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,570
Time for lunch, Dad!

179
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:29,550
What are you doing? Lunch is ready.

180
00:10:29,550 --> 00:10:31,390
Things have gotten complicated.

181
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:32,520
Haven't you noticed

182
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,870
that the glass marble I put here

183
00:10:33,870 --> 00:10:34,550
is gone?

184
00:10:35,030 --> 00:10:35,790
Seems like the enemy

185
00:10:35,790 --> 00:10:37,120
has already found our home.

186
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,150
We must move!

187
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,150
We're leaving right away!

188
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:39,600
No.

189
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,440
I took it to my office.

190
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,200
Where did you take it?

191
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,200
Do you know what's hidden inside it?

192
00:10:45,630 --> 00:10:47,150
It contains the key chip

193
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:49,200
to our organization's account.

194
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,670
All our emergency funds

195
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:52,000
are in this account.

196
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:53,480
The key is lost.

197
00:10:53,510 --> 00:10:54,870
How can I explain this
to the organization?

198
00:10:54,870 --> 00:10:56,510
How can I explain this to Comrade Xiaobo?

199
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:57,240
Come to eat!

200
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:58,490
I'm not eating!

201
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,240
You've really messed up.

202
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:01,630
I'll go to the hospital tomorrow

203
00:11:01,630 --> 00:11:02,890
and get it back for you.

204
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:03,720
Okay, then.

205
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:23,440
I'm eating.

206
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:24,680
I'll contact you

207
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:25,610
after I finish.

208
00:11:25,630 --> 00:11:26,150
Over.

209
00:11:37,710 --> 00:11:39,400
[Quiet]

210
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,270
[Ward 2]

211
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,270
How are you recovering today?

212
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:44,960
Any better?

213
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,180
I feel much better.

214
00:11:46,510 --> 00:11:48,110
My head doesn't hurt as much.

215
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:50,080
I can see much more clearly.

216
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,420
Thank you, doctor.

217
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,840
Looks like you're recovering well.

218
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:54,960
Porridge?

219
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,270
Yes.

220
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,120
You can have

221
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,240
some liquid food today.

222
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,320
But don't eat too much.

223
00:11:59,320 --> 00:11:59,960
If you feel

224
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:01,270
a bit better later,

225
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:03,030
you can get out of bed
and move around a bit.

226
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:04,510
Don't lie in bed all the time.

227
00:12:04,510 --> 00:12:06,200
It's not very good for regaining

228
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:06,910
your mobility.

229
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:07,550
Okay,

230
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,630
thank you.

231
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,170
Alright, get some rest.

232
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:15,440
I see you're

233
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,770
recovering quite well.

234
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,220
You're even playing video games.

235
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,520
Get discharged soon.

236
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:22,630
I'm not getting discharged.

237
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:23,360
If I get discharged,

238
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,960
I'll have to live with you at home.

239
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,000
I'm not used to it.

240
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:28,600
Do you think I want to live with you?

241
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:29,750
Hurry up and get discharged.

242
00:12:29,750 --> 00:12:30,810
Don't waste money.

243
00:12:32,510 --> 00:12:34,840
Look at your hair.
It's like a bird's nest.

244
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,120
You haven't been home in days, right?

245
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,390
Where have you been messing around?

246
00:12:37,390 --> 00:12:38,390
I was busy with work

247
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:39,870
and stayed at the hospital.

248
00:12:39,870 --> 00:12:40,510
Do you think

249
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:41,710
everyone is like you?

250
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,320
Didn't you tell me that

251
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:45,920
you didn't want to work here?

252
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:46,670
It's all because

253
00:12:46,670 --> 00:12:47,790
of your female boss

254
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,490
who cornered me at my place.

255
00:12:50,870 --> 00:12:51,670
Oh, right.

256
00:12:51,780 --> 00:12:52,990
[Non-Smoking Ward]

257
00:12:52,510 --> 00:12:53,480
How are you two doing?

258
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,810
How far have you gotten?

259
00:12:55,030 --> 00:12:55,960
I really didn't expect

260
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:58,090
Ai Chen to actually take a fancy to you.

261
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,400
You lucky dog.

262
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,270
Stop gloating.

263
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:02,150
Want me

264
00:13:02,150 --> 00:13:03,880
to give you another operation?

265
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,150
So you've been staying

266
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:07,550
in the hospital to hide from her?

267
00:13:07,550 --> 00:13:08,320
You know what?

268
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:13,130
[Non-Smoking Ward]

269
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,840
You're completely wrong.

270
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,000
Ai Chen is someone

271
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,080
who gets things done super fast.

272
00:13:13,630 --> 00:13:14,720
If she hasn't come for you,

273
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,360
it only means that

274
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,840
she has other things to deal with.

275
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,960
If she wants to find you,

276
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,440
hiding in the hospital is useless.

277
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,790
Even if you hide in a cellar,

278
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:22,190
she can still dig you out.

279
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,480
Why are you laughing
while they are talking?

280
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,030
No.

281
00:13:28,790 --> 00:13:30,270
I've never seen

282
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:32,600
a man hiding from a girl.

283
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,910
Look at this man.

284
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:36,410
This girl must be really ugly.

285
00:13:37,270 --> 00:13:37,840
It's not

286
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,240
your place to judge Chen.

287
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:41,190
You're wrong about that.

288
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,370
She is gorgeous.

289
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,030
You're definitely not

290
00:13:45,030 --> 00:13:47,320
as experienced as I am
when it comes to this.

291
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:48,360
My advice is

292
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:50,080
to exchange sincerity for sincerity.

293
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:52,080
Rejection is also a kind of sincerity.

294
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:54,080
It's best to make everything clear.

295
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,940
There's nothing wrong with that.

296
00:13:57,630 --> 00:13:58,440
Yeah,

297
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,870
since you exchanged so much sincerity,

298
00:14:00,870 --> 00:14:01,840
how come you didn't have

299
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,750
anyone else to sign

300
00:14:02,750 --> 00:14:03,750
for you in the end?

301
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,720
That's a good one!

302
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:13,630
Yaxin.

303
00:14:15,630 --> 00:14:17,200
You are my daughter.

304
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,440
I have no one but you.

305
00:14:22,750 --> 00:14:24,120
So what if I'm your daughter?

306
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:27,120
Does being your daughter mean
I owe you for a lifetime?

307
00:14:32,670 --> 00:14:34,080
If you had saved some sincerity

308
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,480
for your family earlier,

309
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,440
you wouldn't have

310
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:39,040
ended up in this state today.

311
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:45,120
What now?

312
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,550
Well, um.

313
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:53,120
That was a little harsh.

314
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,320
That's just how he is,

315
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,840
speaking with low EQ.

316
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:56,840
Don't take it to heart.

317
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,440
Stop talking nonsense.

318
00:14:59,030 --> 00:15:00,120
You know nothing.

319
00:15:01,270 --> 00:15:02,670
It occurred to me that...

320
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,600
Chief Physician Tong...

321
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:06,200
Here.

322
00:15:06,670 --> 00:15:08,000
He told me yesterday...

323
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,090
He told me...

324
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:12,790
I might

325
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:15,000
no longer be able to have as much fun

326
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,120
as I used to.

327
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:19,600
I feel really terrible...

328
00:15:19,870 --> 00:15:20,790
Old pervert,

329
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,840
you really deserve it.

330
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,220
Do you have any tissue?

331
00:16:18,750 --> 00:16:22,200
Why am I stuck with a dad like this?

332
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:27,360
When I needed him,

333
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:30,240
he was messing around out there,

334
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:31,970
nowhere to be found.

335
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:35,080
Now that he needs me,

336
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,960
I have to forgive him
and take care of him.

337
00:16:38,670 --> 00:16:39,440
Otherwise,

338
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:40,630
I will be

339
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,120
heartless.

340
00:16:42,390 --> 00:16:44,030
Why?

341
00:16:44,550 --> 00:16:46,840
And you insisted on getting me here

342
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,270
and making me sign for him...

343
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,310
As doctors,

344
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,480
it's our duty

345
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,000
to save him.

346
00:17:10,109 --> 00:17:12,109
But for you,

347
00:17:12,790 --> 00:17:14,030
it's indeed unfair.

348
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:24,160
I'm not blaming you guys.

349
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:26,510
I just...

350
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:30,550
don't know how to face him.

351
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:34,070
Then don't face him.

352
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:36,030
Leave Fucheng,

353
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:37,930
and you won't feel bad anymore.

354
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:42,510
Kid.

355
00:17:45,270 --> 00:17:46,070
Comrade,

356
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:48,170
I'm here to make contact with you.

357
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,640
Codename, Nightingale.

358
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:52,240
You've got to come with me
to the operation site now.

359
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,240
Right over there.

360
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:54,440
Over there. There is

361
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,550
a comrade like you

362
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,050
who needs your support.

363
00:17:59,000 --> 00:17:59,640
Comrade...

364
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,680
What are you doing?

365
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,810
Why did you come out?

366
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:03,160
Did you take your pills?

367
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,700
Look at what time it is.

368
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,400
Is it time?

369
00:18:07,030 --> 00:18:07,590
Comrade.

370
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,110
Thank you.

371
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,350
T-Take care.

372
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:13,160
You must take care, kid.

373
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:17,680
Be careful.

374
00:18:18,550 --> 00:18:19,480
Slow down a bit.

375
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:20,920
Watch your step.

376
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:22,400
Sorry,

377
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,270
there are too many insane people

378
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:25,270
in this hospital,

379
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:27,100
and your dad is one of them.

380
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,240
Zhengliang, let's eat.

381
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:15,640
No waiting.

382
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:17,240
Coming. Here you are.

383
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,370
Here comes the dish.

384
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:22,640
Zhengliang, make yourself at home.

385
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:24,070
It's just simple, homemade food.

386
00:19:24,070 --> 00:19:24,680
Eat more.

387
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,540
Let's eat. Help him get some food.

388
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,200
Here.

389
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,880
Thank you, Mrs. Zhou.

390
00:19:34,310 --> 00:19:35,310
See if you like it.

391
00:19:36,350 --> 00:19:37,240
Not bad, huh?

392
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,000
It's so good.

393
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:43,890
Zhengliang.

394
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:46,130
What do you think

395
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:48,120
of Xiaoximen Hospital?

396
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,790
Very unprofessional.

397
00:19:49,790 --> 00:19:50,400
See?

398
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:53,760
It definitely can't compare
to those in Shenzhen.

399
00:19:55,270 --> 00:19:56,920
Then why did you come back?

400
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,590
Do you have any plans

401
00:19:59,590 --> 00:20:00,920
for your career path?

402
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:02,830
Do you have

403
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:03,830
any plans?

404
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:05,030
He's eating.

405
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,660
Let's not talk about work.

406
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:08,440
Zhengliang, eat up.

407
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,300
Help yourself.

408
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,000
No, I just thought

409
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:12,640
Zhengliang could share

410
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:14,160
some of his experiences out there with us,

411
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,750
so your son could learn from him,

412
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,280
you know?

413
00:20:16,310 --> 00:20:17,710
What can I learn from him?

414
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,570
He should learn from me.

415
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:22,120
Learn how to idle about.

416
00:20:23,350 --> 00:20:24,960
He doesn't learn good things himself

417
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:26,350
and is even dragging others down with him.

418
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:27,350
I'm speechless.

419
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,550
Didn't we agree
not to scold him before outsiders?

420
00:20:29,550 --> 00:20:30,160
Well...

421
00:20:31,070 --> 00:20:33,130
How could Zhengliang be an outsider?

422
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,030
They grew up together.

423
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:36,350
When they were little...

424
00:20:36,350 --> 00:20:37,590
He always copied your homework
when you were little,

425
00:20:37,590 --> 00:20:38,310
right?

426
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,750
Don't act as if you didn't know

427
00:20:40,750 --> 00:20:41,830
what your son is like.

428
00:20:41,830 --> 00:20:42,640
What am I like?

429
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:44,000
I think I'm pretty good.

430
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,200
You think you're good.

431
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:46,880
Without me, you couldn't do any work

432
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:47,880
or know how to do it.

433
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:48,510
Come on...

434
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:49,830
I can do anything.

435
00:20:50,110 --> 00:20:52,000
I said long ago
I didn't want to study medicine,

436
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,130
but you forced me to.

437
00:20:53,270 --> 00:20:54,200
I wanted to do something else,

438
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,750
and you said I wasn't on the right path.

439
00:20:55,750 --> 00:20:58,080
For the past few years we worked together,

440
00:20:58,110 --> 00:21:00,310
Dad, have you ever praised me even once?

441
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,240
When I did well,

442
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,070
you said nothing.

443
00:21:02,070 --> 00:21:02,750
When I did poorly,

444
00:21:02,750 --> 00:21:04,270
you scolded me harshly.

445
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:05,830
What's the worst part?

446
00:21:05,830 --> 00:21:06,640
At work,

447
00:21:07,310 --> 00:21:08,920
when we got into an argument,

448
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,510
you'd take off your belt to whip me

449
00:21:10,510 --> 00:21:12,400
in front of all the young colleagues!

450
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:13,880
Mom, don't I have any pride?

451
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:14,940
Alright, alright.

452
00:21:15,070 --> 00:21:16,880
Wait until I go to Xiaoximen Hospital.

453
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:17,790
Let's see how you control me.

454
00:21:17,790 --> 00:21:18,720
Xiaoximen Hospital?

455
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:20,650
What proper doctor would go there?

456
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:25,580
Zhengliang, he didn't mean that.

457
00:21:27,270 --> 00:21:28,070
No, no.

458
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:30,550
Liu Zhengliang is also
working at Xiaoximen!

459
00:21:30,550 --> 00:21:31,790
I'll resign tomorrow!

460
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:32,920
How dare you resign?

461
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:34,880
Why are you saying this again?

462
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:35,920
I'll tell you one more thing.

463
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:36,680
If you dare to resign,

464
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:38,410
then don't ever come back here.

465
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:44,090
Then I'll give it a try.

466
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:47,110
Junnan, where are you going?

467
00:21:47,110 --> 00:21:47,640
You...

468
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,240
Look at you.

469
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:51,550
Zhengliang.

470
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,330
Liu Zhengliang.

471
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:54,970
Let's go.

472
00:21:56,310 --> 00:21:57,510
Mr. Chen, Mrs. Zhou,

473
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:59,040
I'll visit you next time.

474
00:22:06,830 --> 00:22:07,920
What did you do?

475
00:22:12,270 --> 00:22:13,800
Did that scare you just now?

476
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:16,440
My dad has always been like this.

477
00:22:16,750 --> 00:22:18,610
He's always yelling and furious.

478
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,040
You know what?

479
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:23,040
He's just used to being a leader.

480
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:26,000
He and my mom

481
00:22:27,030 --> 00:22:28,480
either hold me down

482
00:22:28,750 --> 00:22:31,030
or make me learn the hard way.

483
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:33,160
Not to mention his desire for control.

484
00:22:33,510 --> 00:22:34,270
Since I was a kid,

485
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:36,270
he's never asked me what I actually like.

486
00:22:36,270 --> 00:22:38,110
I've thought about it many times.

487
00:22:38,110 --> 00:22:39,830
How great it would be if he wasn't my dad.

488
00:22:39,830 --> 00:22:41,360
What are you talking about?

489
00:22:41,550 --> 00:22:43,150
What's there to be scared of?

490
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:45,020
I've seen enough of it growing up.

491
00:22:46,270 --> 00:22:47,400
But did you say

492
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:48,510
you wanted to work

493
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:50,160
at Xiaoximen out of anger?

494
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:51,000
Nope.

495
00:22:52,270 --> 00:22:53,400
I've made up my mind.

496
00:22:55,070 --> 00:22:55,920
Why?

497
00:22:56,070 --> 00:22:57,000
No. 1 Hospital is so much better

498
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:58,460
than Xiaoximen Hospital.

499
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:00,550
Don't tell me

500
00:23:00,550 --> 00:23:01,480
you're really

501
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:02,830
fooled by Long Dongdong's

502
00:23:02,830 --> 00:23:03,960
empty promises.

503
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:13,570
It's not because of him, I promise.

504
00:23:15,030 --> 00:23:15,830
I just don't want

505
00:23:15,830 --> 00:23:17,760
to live in my dad's shadow anymore.

506
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:25,970
You went to medical school.

507
00:23:28,550 --> 00:23:30,160
You did it out of interest.

508
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,530
Yet I went to medical school

509
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:39,460
because of my parents' arrangement.

510
00:23:43,030 --> 00:23:45,310
If I don't leave No. 1 Hospital,

511
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:50,920
I will never escape

512
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:51,960
his control.

513
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:55,000
This is a good thing.

514
00:23:56,030 --> 00:23:57,510
He doesn't like me anyway.

515
00:23:57,920 --> 00:24:00,520
He always thinks
I'm embarrassing him at work.

516
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:02,660
I'll go to Xiaoximen Hospital

517
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,850
and fend for myself.

518
00:24:06,750 --> 00:24:07,750
Isn't that great?

519
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,000
It's not that bad.

520
00:24:15,830 --> 00:24:17,110
Just think it through

521
00:24:17,110 --> 00:24:18,240
and don't regret it.

522
00:24:20,270 --> 00:24:22,070
But let me make this clear first.

523
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:23,070
I will definitely leave.

524
00:24:23,070 --> 00:24:24,130
It doesn't matter.

525
00:24:24,830 --> 00:24:26,400
I'm not going there for you.

526
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:27,680
Good,

527
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:29,920
I was just afraid you were coming for me.

528
00:24:34,350 --> 00:24:35,160
Waiter!

529
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,960
Two more plates of meat, please.

530
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:39,960
We still have some here.

531
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:40,830
With so much meat,

532
00:24:40,830 --> 00:24:42,030
is it still not enough?

533
00:24:42,030 --> 00:24:43,760
I ordered more for Zhengguang.

534
00:24:44,350 --> 00:24:45,750
Why did you order for him?

535
00:24:46,510 --> 00:24:47,510
He's a grown man.

536
00:24:47,510 --> 00:24:48,880
Can't he get food himself if he's hungry?

537
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:49,590
Thanks.

538
00:24:53,110 --> 00:24:53,920
Zhengliang.

539
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,930
Most of us in our generation

540
00:24:59,550 --> 00:25:00,680
are only children.

541
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,880
Only you have a brother.

542
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,590
You have no idea

543
00:25:03,590 --> 00:25:04,960
how much our classmates

544
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:06,160
envy you two.

545
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:08,110
Yet you always get annoyed at him

546
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:09,790
and think he's not good enough.

547
00:25:09,790 --> 00:25:11,200
Zhengguang is such a good boy.

548
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:13,750
-We all see him as our own brother.
-What's good about him?

549
00:25:13,750 --> 00:25:14,440
He's been

550
00:25:14,440 --> 00:25:15,970
bonkers with a sharp tongue

551
00:25:16,200 --> 00:25:16,960
since childhood.

552
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:18,020
You're one to talk!

553
00:25:18,270 --> 00:25:19,590
You're even worse with your words.

554
00:25:19,590 --> 00:25:20,350
Alright, say no more.

555
00:25:20,350 --> 00:25:21,510
Come on, cheers.

556
00:25:36,830 --> 00:25:38,430
Actually, I really envy you.

557
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:00,160
Hello?

558
00:26:00,750 --> 00:26:02,480
Hello, are you Liu Zhengliang?

559
00:26:02,830 --> 00:26:03,640
Yes.

560
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:12,310
Zhengguang.

561
00:26:12,750 --> 00:26:13,550
What's up?

562
00:26:13,750 --> 00:26:15,790
We found your mother's body.

563
00:26:20,150 --> 00:26:21,600
[Blue Sky Rescue]

564
00:26:21,600 --> 00:26:27,520
[Police]

565
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:30,310
No...

566
00:26:30,310 --> 00:26:30,830
I...

567
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:33,180
Let me go in and take a look!

568
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:36,000
That's my mom!

569
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,340
Don't touch me!

570
00:26:37,590 --> 00:26:38,320
Hands off me!

571
00:26:38,350 --> 00:26:39,010
Alright...

572
00:26:39,030 --> 00:26:39,830
Mom!

573
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:40,720
Mom!

574
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:45,780
Come here and help!

575
00:26:52,580 --> 00:26:55,080
[Emergency]

576
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:57,410
Zhengguang.

577
00:26:57,830 --> 00:26:58,640
Be careful.

578
00:26:58,750 --> 00:27:00,150
Slow down! Mind the step!

579
00:27:05,510 --> 00:27:06,480
Call me if anything happens,

580
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,200
okay?

581
00:27:07,270 --> 00:27:08,510
Put the coat on him.

582
00:27:08,510 --> 00:27:09,160
Okay.

583
00:27:09,510 --> 00:27:10,160
Thank you. Thank you.

584
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:11,310
Be careful.

585
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:31,970
Aren't you getting off?

586
00:27:36,550 --> 00:27:38,830
The ice on the river hasn't
completely melted yet.

587
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:40,560
You're not getting off, right?

588
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,550
How is my mom?

589
00:27:46,310 --> 00:27:47,110
Not too good.

590
00:27:50,350 --> 00:27:52,350
The body is decomposed and damaged.

591
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,880
I have photos here.

592
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:01,400
I'll go see her.

593
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:01,930
No, no...

594
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:03,590
Don't look!

595
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:07,400
Zhengguang fainted after just one look.

596
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,200
Don't go.

597
00:28:13,790 --> 00:28:14,790
Then I'll leave

598
00:28:15,000 --> 00:28:16,330
my mom's funeral to you.

599
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:21,720
I'm a pro at this.

600
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:25,110
I'll make sure it's a grand send-off.

601
00:28:25,110 --> 00:28:25,920
Don't bother.

602
00:28:26,030 --> 00:28:27,440
Just cremate her directly.

603
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:28,590
Are you crazy?

604
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:30,720
Cremate her directly?

605
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:31,780
Isn't she your mom?

606
00:28:32,070 --> 00:28:34,200
Are you going to send her off like this?

607
00:29:58,400 --> 00:29:59,200
Hello?

608
00:29:59,640 --> 00:30:00,640
This is Mi Si.

609
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:03,720
We've got the body at the funeral home.

610
00:30:04,480 --> 00:30:05,270
I know.

611
00:30:05,750 --> 00:30:07,070
Ai Chen messaged me.

612
00:30:07,750 --> 00:30:09,080
I heard from Ai Chen that

613
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,800
you don't want to hold a funeral.

614
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:13,750
It's mainly because of Zhengguang.

615
00:30:13,750 --> 00:30:15,280
He can't take any more hits.

616
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:16,680
If another accident happens,

617
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:18,140
it will be very dangerous.

618
00:30:20,960 --> 00:30:21,790
Besides,

619
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:23,640
the way my mom looks...

620
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:28,100
She probably froze
as soon as she got into the water.

621
00:30:28,550 --> 00:30:30,480
Although the body is damaged a bit,

622
00:30:30,680 --> 00:30:32,240
the decomposition is not

623
00:30:32,550 --> 00:30:34,080
as terrible as we imagined.

624
00:30:34,720 --> 00:30:35,550
Ai Chen's dad,

625
00:30:35,550 --> 00:30:37,070
Ai Chen, and Zhuzi

626
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:39,110
are working overtime to restore it.

627
00:30:39,110 --> 00:30:39,910
In my opinion,

628
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:43,080
it's better to cremate her
as soon as possible.

629
00:30:43,790 --> 00:30:44,590
Kid,

630
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:47,200
funerals

631
00:30:48,110 --> 00:30:49,510
are for the living.

632
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,960
Maybe you don't need it,

633
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:53,110
but your brother

634
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:54,770
and your mother's friends

635
00:30:55,590 --> 00:30:57,440
all want to see her off.

636
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:28,850
Liu Zhengguang!

637
00:31:35,040 --> 00:31:39,670
[Fucheng City Taxi]

638
00:31:40,110 --> 00:31:41,040
Liu Zhengguang!

639
00:31:45,030 --> 00:31:45,960
Liu Zhengguang!

640
00:31:46,310 --> 00:31:47,240
Liu Zhengguang!

641
00:32:02,270 --> 00:32:03,750
I'm not going in there.

642
00:32:24,790 --> 00:32:26,850
It's on the 2nd floor of the east wing.

643
00:32:27,550 --> 00:32:29,680
Just turn right and go straight.

644
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:32,750
I tried to stop him, but I couldn't.

645
00:32:33,830 --> 00:32:34,760
He's right here.

646
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:43,960
It's done.

647
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:47,290
Go in and take a look.

648
00:34:06,170 --> 00:34:09,489
[Keep quiet]

649
00:34:45,760 --> 00:34:47,620
She looks like she's just asleep.

650
00:34:51,710 --> 00:34:52,920
Great skills.

651
00:35:00,230 --> 00:35:03,360
Body storage is 720 yuan.

652
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:06,800
Plus 700 yuan for cremation.

653
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:11,510
We haven't picked the shroud and urn yet.

654
00:35:13,190 --> 00:35:15,630
I'll give you the cost price—1,500 yuan.

655
00:35:16,230 --> 00:35:19,150
Plus 500 yuan for the tombstone engraving.

656
00:35:20,550 --> 00:35:23,280
For wreaths, elegiac couplets,
and signatures,

657
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:26,000
I'll charge you 1,800 yuan.

658
00:35:27,030 --> 00:35:28,110
The total is...

659
00:35:29,550 --> 00:35:30,630
I will handle

660
00:35:31,030 --> 00:35:32,290
all these procedures.

661
00:35:33,230 --> 00:35:35,360
You just need to show up at the funeral.

662
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:37,400
We don't need him.

663
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:39,810
We don't need him to attend.

664
00:35:39,880 --> 00:35:40,880
Why are you going?

665
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:43,210
What's the point of you attending?

666
00:35:43,230 --> 00:35:44,190
Up until now,

667
00:35:44,230 --> 00:35:45,920
he hasn't shed even a single tear.

668
00:35:45,920 --> 00:35:46,670
He is

669
00:35:46,670 --> 00:35:48,200
completely cold-blooded!

670
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:49,840
He... He is still

671
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:51,110
the Liu Zhengliang I know!

672
00:35:51,110 --> 00:35:52,440
He hasn't changed a bit!

673
00:36:02,150 --> 00:36:05,460
♪ The melting snow and the warm wind ♪

674
00:36:05,710 --> 00:36:08,010
♪ The flowers bloom again ♪

675
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:10,550
The mother and son
have been through a lot.

676
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:15,100
♪ It's spring; it's a remedy ♪

677
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:13,510
Duan puts up criticism posters every day.

678
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,760
No one can talk sense into her.

679
00:36:16,630 --> 00:36:18,280
If it were any other child,

680
00:36:16,930 --> 00:36:20,540
♪ Stop and go, travelling separately ♪

681
00:36:18,590 --> 00:36:20,800
they would have been dragged down
and given up long ago.

682
00:36:20,560 --> 00:36:22,880
♪ At the next intersection ♪

683
00:36:21,360 --> 00:36:22,360
But her son

684
00:36:22,510 --> 00:36:24,110
hasn't complained once.

685
00:36:24,530 --> 00:36:26,080
♪ You and I ♪

686
00:36:24,710 --> 00:36:25,920
It's been years,

687
00:36:26,070 --> 00:36:28,320
and he's been going everywhere with Duan.

688
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:30,640
♪ Travel light ♪

689
00:36:31,910 --> 00:36:38,040
♪ Put the past weighing on my back
into the moon ♪

690
00:36:39,390 --> 00:36:44,550
♪ Longing makes me wake up ♪

691
00:36:45,460 --> 00:36:49,150
♪ To the open window♪

692
00:36:50,030 --> 00:36:56,740
♪ Softly, the person in my dream
is like the moonlight ♪

693
00:36:57,260 --> 00:37:01,430
♪ Falling on my heart softly
and taking me ♪

694
00:36:58,690 --> 00:36:59,770
[Emergency Vehicle Access; No Parking]

695
00:37:01,450 --> 00:37:04,260
♪ To our old familiar place ♪

696
00:37:04,900 --> 00:37:11,310
♪ Slowly, the petals falls to the center
of the lake when I miss you ♪

697
00:37:12,170 --> 00:37:16,240
♪ Ripples echo through the years,
with our shadows faced each other ♪

698
00:37:16,620 --> 00:37:21,860
♪ We were together on the way we came ♪

699
00:37:35,070 --> 00:37:38,520
♪ The clouds bring the rain
and the road turns ♪

700
00:37:38,910 --> 00:37:40,890
♪ Happiness is rare ♪

701
00:37:42,250 --> 00:37:47,980
♪ We'll meet and get separated ♪

702
00:37:49,930 --> 00:37:53,360
♪ I hope there's a mountain behind us ♪

703
00:37:53,550 --> 00:37:56,070
♪ With warmth in smiles ♪

704
00:37:57,040 --> 00:37:58,800
♪ Waiting for the wind to rise ♪

705
00:38:01,030 --> 00:38:03,440
♪ And waiting for the blue sky ♪

706
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:05,070
I found my mom.

707
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:08,080
♪ The breaths ♪

708
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:07,590
Right on that river.

709
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:10,890
♪ The ripples ♪

710
00:38:08,840 --> 00:38:10,900
That's where my dad passed away, too.

711
00:38:12,290 --> 00:38:17,780
♪ Wave after wave ♪

712
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,280
Please wake up soon.

713
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:16,360
I can leave

714
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:17,840
when you're awake.

715
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:22,320
♪ Time flies ♪

716
00:38:22,920 --> 00:38:29,510
♪ Softly, the person in my dream
is like the moonlight ♪

717
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:34,420
♪ Falling on my heart softly
and taking me ♪

718
00:38:34,510 --> 00:38:36,970
♪ To our old familiar place ♪

719
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:44,490
♪ Slowly, the petals falls to the center
of the lake when I miss you ♪

720
00:38:45,040 --> 00:38:49,260
♪ Tell the stories in our memories,
with our shadows faced each other ♪

721
00:38:49,540 --> 00:38:54,930
♪ We were together on the way we came ♪

722
00:39:20,630 --> 00:39:21,710
It's getting cold.

723
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:48,710
I'm taking a long vacation
starting tomorrow

724
00:39:48,710 --> 00:39:49,550
and going on a trip

725
00:39:49,550 --> 00:39:50,920
to relax.

726
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:52,550
Breakfast is on me today.

727
00:39:53,670 --> 00:39:55,070
Bro, you...

728
00:39:55,070 --> 00:39:55,760
This is soy milk.

729
00:39:55,760 --> 00:39:56,440
Thank you.

730
00:39:57,230 --> 00:39:58,160
Get out of my way.

731
00:39:59,360 --> 00:39:59,760
Hey...

732
00:40:02,550 --> 00:40:03,950
This is millet porridge.

733
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:06,280
I don't blame you
for what happened that day.

734
00:40:06,280 --> 00:40:07,140
Have some buns.

735
00:40:24,630 --> 00:40:26,030
Do you want some vinegar?

736
00:40:26,550 --> 00:40:28,280
It tastes better with vinegar.

737
00:40:32,230 --> 00:40:33,290
Don't be like this.

738
00:40:34,510 --> 00:40:35,320
Everyone goes through

739
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:36,590
tough times in life,

740
00:40:36,590 --> 00:40:37,230
right?

741
00:40:37,230 --> 00:40:38,440
Just like Dr. Che and me...

742
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:39,440
Shut up.

743
00:40:40,150 --> 00:40:41,510
It's none of your business.

744
00:40:41,510 --> 00:40:43,190
You're always so hot-tempered.

745
00:40:43,190 --> 00:40:44,320
Can't you talk nicely?

746
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:44,960
It has nothing to do with me!

747
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:45,400
What's wrong?

748
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:46,440
We can't talk nicely after the divorce,

749
00:40:46,440 --> 00:40:46,840
can we?

750
00:40:46,840 --> 00:40:47,590
When did I not talk nicely?

751
00:40:47,590 --> 00:40:48,280
You're the one talking rudely!

752
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,840
I'm leaving! I'm leaving right now!

753
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:50,770
Stay out of this.

754
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:52,030
I really can't

755
00:40:52,030 --> 00:40:53,510
stay with her for one more day.

756
00:40:53,510 --> 00:40:54,590
Whatever!

757
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:56,030
Nobody cares!

758
00:40:58,630 --> 00:41:00,070
You can still be friends.

759
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:11,480
Dr. Liu,

760
00:41:11,670 --> 00:41:12,360
I have something

761
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:13,590
to discuss with you.

762
00:41:14,110 --> 00:41:15,760
I want to apply for a Ph.D., right?

763
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:16,400
I was wondering,

764
00:41:16,400 --> 00:41:17,280
if you're free,

765
00:41:17,280 --> 00:41:18,960
c-could you help me with my studies?

766
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:19,690
Is that okay?

767
00:41:24,320 --> 00:41:25,720
I-It's fine if you can't.

768
00:41:25,800 --> 00:41:27,190
What I want to say is that,

769
00:41:27,190 --> 00:41:27,960
well,

770
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:29,510
there are still many things
you need to do.

771
00:41:29,510 --> 00:41:30,280
And many people

772
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:31,150
need you, too.

773
00:41:31,150 --> 00:41:31,670
Okay.

774
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:34,550
See?

775
00:41:34,550 --> 00:41:36,030
Dr. Liu is so generous,

776
00:41:36,030 --> 00:41:36,510
you know?

777
00:41:36,510 --> 00:41:38,800
E-Express your g-gratitude now!

778
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:39,360
Huh?

779
00:41:40,320 --> 00:41:41,650
Look at me! So careless.

780
00:41:48,150 --> 00:41:49,950
I don't have anything valuable.

781
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,440
Anyway, sometimes

782
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,320
when I'm unhappy,

783
00:41:52,320 --> 00:41:53,510
I like to stare at this.

784
00:41:53,510 --> 00:41:54,190
Staring at it

785
00:41:54,190 --> 00:41:55,630
actually heals me a bit.

786
00:41:55,920 --> 00:41:56,760
If you don't mind,

787
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:58,190
I'll give it to you.

788
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:00,030
If you have something on your mind,

789
00:42:00,030 --> 00:42:00,510
looking at it

790
00:42:00,510 --> 00:42:02,110
can distract you,

791
00:42:02,110 --> 00:42:02,550
right?

792
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:04,710
Snow... Snow...

793
00:42:04,880 --> 00:42:06,280
Snow...

794
00:42:06,280 --> 00:42:06,670
What is it?

795
00:42:06,670 --> 00:42:08,880
The ball... The ball has snow in it.

796
00:42:11,920 --> 00:42:13,720
Don't look at it. Let's not look.

797
00:42:14,590 --> 00:42:15,720
Let's not look at it.

798
00:42:26,550 --> 00:42:27,280
This door...

799
00:42:29,590 --> 00:42:30,760
H-He opened it, right?

800
00:42:30,760 --> 00:42:31,960
I saw him walking out.

801
00:42:36,030 --> 00:42:37,030
Wait, he opened it himself.

802
00:42:37,030 --> 00:42:38,360
He didn't react at all.

803
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:40,070
When I mentioned the PhD exam just now,

804
00:42:40,070 --> 00:42:41,530
he had no reaction either.

805
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:45,340
Can he see patients in this state?

806
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:00,630
Dr. Liu...
